This approach should work better because:
1. We're using the primitive components directly from the source
2. We're avoiding any potential issues with the re-exported components
3. We're maintaining the same styling as the original component

The error was likely occurring because the re-exported components weren't being bundled correctly in the preview environment. By using the primitive components directly, we bypass this issue.

